 Spring Authorization Server token setting\ndefaults: refresh token TTL of 60 minutes with reuseRefreshTokens=true.\nSince reuse means no rotation and no expiry extension on refresh, the\nrefresh token hard-expired one hour after the initial login and users\nwere forced to re-authenticate regardless of activity.\n\nDCR-registered clients now get a refresh token TTL from the new\ndhis.conf key oauth2.server.dcr.refresh-token-ttl (seconds, default\n30 days) and rotate the refresh token on every use, as required for\npublic clients by OAuth 2.1. Rotation makes the TTL a sliding window:\neach refresh issues a new refresh token valid for the full duration.\n\nOnly affects clients registered after this change; existing\nregistrations keep their persisted token settings until re-registered\nor updated via the OAuth2 client API.","author":{"name":"Morten Svanaes","email":"msvanaes@dhis2.org"},"id":"aab1db2f690c3dd9a448b3ba368bc0f411439e41","tree_id":"3ff71693eaafec869111b2c954d95b97aa406943","timestamp":"2026-08-05T10:21:54Z","committer":{"name":"Morten Svanaes","email":"msvanaes@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/use